@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### Get All Revenue Predict
GET {{base_url}}/api/revenue-predict

### Get Revenue Predict by Date
GET {{base_url}}/api/revenue-predict/2026-01-15

### Create Revenue Predict
POST {{base_url}}/api/revenue-predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-01-15",
  "predictedRevenue": 5000.00
}

### Update Revenue Predict
PUT {{base_url}}/api/revenue-predict/2026-01-15
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-01-15",
  "predictedRevenue": 7500.00
}

### Delete Revenue Predict
DELETE {{base_url}}/api/revenue-predict/2026-01-15